{
 "about": "#113: small things: the elder (a dark robe, a khăn, a white beard) and his greeting, the notebook (each print has a picture), and the map (each lock on its land, and the goal Văn Miếu with its road).",
 "start": "?story=trial-scholar",
 "lang": "vi",
 "allow": [
  "is under the bottom of the screen",
  "and the press did nothing"
